{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>Go now to the flock</b> — נא\"ל (rashei teivot: נאה לך). Beautiful for you. Beautiful for you and beautiful for your children, for it was Passover, and he took two — one for Passover and one for חגיגה." "<b>And take me from there two</b> — מש\"ל (rashei teivot: משלו). משם in gematria: משלי, for so he wrote for her in her ketubah."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:17:10.299755970Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}